From: Emmanuel <aloziefrompg@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 07:07:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Welcome and test email at check-in, personal test link

Every guest who is checked in (door scan, search, walk-in, Attendance page) gets the welcome and test email once, with a personal Take the test button. It goes out even when the test is not open yet.
The test page opens from that link with no code: details first, then instructions, Start or Continue, the questions with the timer, then details and results.
Tests page shows how many have the email and can send it to those who do not.

